  "contentHtml": "<p>1. 사이언스올 실험안전자료----여기에 들어가셔서 몇 개 선택하시면 되세요. </p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.scienceall.com/category/science_learning/study_sci/%ec%8b%a4%ed%97%98%ec%8b%a4%ec%95%88%ec%a0%84%ec%9e%90%eb%a3%8c_%ea%b3%b5%ed%86%b5/\">https://www.scienceall.com/category/science_learning/study_sci/%ec%8b%a4%ed%97%98%ec%8b%a4%ec%95%88%ec%a0%84%ec%9e%90%eb%a3%8c_%ea%b3%b5%ed%86%b5/</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>2. 실험안전 서약서 ---&nbsp; 저도 받은 파일인데요...제가 만든거는 아닌데 </p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 아마도 여기에 만드신 분이 계실지도 몰라요...</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;중학교에서는 1시간씩 영상보고 이거 받고 실험 시작했습니다. </p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevuJ%26dataid%3D34%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20200408100913&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile285.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F990C2D365E8D24202B8A1D')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 실험 안전 서약서.hwp</a></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
